  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Hello.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 0.96,
      "end_time": 1.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 4.88,
      "end_time": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "How you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 5.24,
      "end_time": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "This meeting is being recorded.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 5.76,
      "end_time": 7.28
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you?",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 7.28,
      "end_time": 7.92
    },
    {
      "text": "There's Brittany as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 8.56,
      "end_time": 9.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I'm good, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 10.08,
      "end_time": 11.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry about that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 11.04,
      "end_time": 11.68
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all right.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 12,
      "end_time": 12.72
    },
    {
      "text": "These things honestly, few minutes late and then it doesn't seem to work properly.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 14,
      "end_time": 18.4
    },
    {
      "text": "But you're both here now, which is great.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 18.88,
      "end_time": 20.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So I don't have a meeting for another 20 minutes, so we can.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 20.96,
      "end_time": 24.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 25.85,
      "end_time": 26.01
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, to be honest, there's one question that will.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 26.01,
      "end_time": 28.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 29.29,
      "end_time": 29.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Determine if we move forward or not.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 29.89,
      "end_time": 31.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Does your system have the ability to qualify people when they request the NDA?",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 32.09,
      "end_time": 38.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Like, can we not give it to everybody and can you say no to people or.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 39.53,
      "end_time": 44.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 45.13,
      "end_time": 45.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 46.25,
      "end_time": 46.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 46.81,
      "end_time": 47.17
    },
    {
      "text": "So, well, I think we've got the right answer for you then.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 47.17,
      "end_time": 49.37
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 49.45,
      "end_time": 49.85
    },
    {
      "text": "So we do.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 50.25,
      "end_time": 50.89
    },
    {
      "text": "We do have a system where they are able to sign an NDA and then that goes into our database.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 50.89,
      "end_time": 58.39
    },
    {
      "text": "And then we.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 58.39,
      "end_time": 59.91
    },
    {
      "text": "So we've.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 60.79,
      "end_time": 61.51
    },
    {
      "text": "We sometimes will have screened them before, but sometimes not if they're in our database already.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 62.07,
      "end_time": 68.07
    },
    {
      "text": "But what we do is every single one of those NDAs that come in, we then check with you first whether you want us to share the IM with them or not.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 68.39,
      "end_time": 76.03
    },
    {
      "text": "And if you don't, they don't get it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 76.03,
      "end_time": 77.59
    },
    {
      "text": "So it stays completely anonymous.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 77.75,
      "end_time": 79.59
    },
    {
      "text": "It's only if you approve those signed NDAs that we will share with them.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 79.67,
      "end_time": 84.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 85.25,
      "end_time": 85.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 86.21,
      "end_time": 86.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 86.69,
      "end_time": 87.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that the right answer?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 88.93,
      "end_time": 90.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 90.21,
      "end_time": 90.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 90.85,
      "end_time": 91.89
    },
    {
      "text": "It's an answer.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 93.25,
      "end_time": 94.01
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know if it's the right one or not, but.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 94.01,
      "end_time": 97.01
    },
    {
      "text": "So what are you hoping?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 97.17,
      "end_time": 98.93
    },
    {
      "text": "How the system works.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 99.09,
      "end_time": 100.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that way.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 100.37,
      "end_time": 101.49
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 101.49,
      "end_time": 101.89
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't want every.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 101.89,
      "end_time": 103.09
    },
    {
      "text": "We're a white label SEO digital marketing company, so I don't want clients finding out, if they reach out to see who we are or whatever, that they would find out that we're, you know, possibly selling the company.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 103.09,
      "end_time": 114.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 115.52,
      "end_time": 116.4
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 116.64,
      "end_time": 117.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, Brittany.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 118.24,
      "end_time": 119.2
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 119.52,
      "end_time": 120.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi.",
      "speaker_name": "Brittany",
      "start_time": 120.32,
      "end_time": 120.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Good.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 120.88,
      "end_time": 121.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Nice to meet you.",
      "speaker_name": "Brittany",
      "start_time": 121.2,
      "end_time": 121.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, nice to meet you, too.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 122.32,
      "end_time": 123.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry, I was three or four minutes late and when I came in, there was nobody, like waiting in the room, so I waited for you guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 123.36,
      "end_time": 130.24
    },
    {
      "text": "But we're all here now, so that's.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 131.68,
      "end_time": 133.28
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all good.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 133.28,
      "end_time": 134.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 135.12,
      "end_time": 135.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 135.52,
      "end_time": 135.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, thank you for booking in a call.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 135.88,
      "end_time": 137.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll give you a little bit of background about us.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 137.76,
      "end_time": 141.02
    },
    {
      "text": "So we are capital A and we're a M and A advisory for marketing services businesses.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 141.02,
      "end_time": 147.74
    },
    {
      "text": "So we work both the buy and the sell side, work with clients who are looking to acquire businesses and they are often scaling agencies that are looking to scale outside of organic or they can be financial investors, like private equity or private investors.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 147.9,
      "end_time": 166.9
    },
    {
      "text": "That are looking to get into the marketing space.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 166.9,
      "end_time": 169.1
    },
    {
      "text": "So we work both sides and our sell side is obviously agencies co which is the marketplace for agency owners to buy and sell marketing agencies.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 170.31,
      "end_time": 182.47
    },
    {
      "text": "So the purpose of this call really is just to understand whereabouts you are.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 183.43,
      "end_time": 188.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously you filled out form.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 188.79,
      "end_time": 189.95
    },
    {
      "text": "We've got those details but you know, what is your goals, why are you considering a sale and whether our six month process is a fit for you guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 189.95,
      "end_time": 199.89
    },
    {
      "text": "If that sounds good.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 200.21,
      "end_time": 201.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, sounds good.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 202.13,
      "end_time": 203.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 207.25,
      "end_time": 207.57
    },
    {
      "text": "So I just.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 207.57,
      "end_time": 208.05
    },
    {
      "text": "The information.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 208.05,
      "end_time": 208.77
    },
    {
      "text": "I can see.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 211.41,
      "end_time": 212.13
    },
    {
      "text": "I think he's breaking up for me.",
