    },
    {
      "text": "Fireflies is still in here, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 268.99,
      "end_time": 271.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, well, I guess I'll give him a minute to rejoin by connection.",
      "speaker_name": "Brittany",
      "start_time": 272.24,
      "end_time": 277.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It.",
      "speaker_name": "Michael",
      "start_time": 297.61,
      "end_time": 297.85
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, well, I'm probably going to jump off here.",
